  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Soldier's Joy (no banjo)**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Steam Powered Aereo Plane**: back after 33 archived shows (533 days) [2]\n- **Untangle Your Mind**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **House Carpenter (Billy Solo)**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Enter The Dragon**: back after 48 archived shows (586 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **I'm Gone, Long Gone**: back after 182 archived shows (1115 days); rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-08-08.BillyStrings2021-08-08** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 90 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Band lineup: Billy Strings on guitar, Billy Failing on banjo, Jarrod Walker on mandolin, Royal Masat on bass, all singing [1]\n- Uploader brought his nephew Dylan McGlinn, whose first festival this was; describes it as a great little festival [1]\n- Levitate staff praised for keeping attendees safe; uploader came with friends from Nantucket [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-08-08.BillyStrings2021-08-08**: taped by G-Man; transferred by G-Man; source: Audio Technica AT 2020> Tascam DR-40X [1]",
